<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LTV Corp upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LTV Corp upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it upgraded LTV Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage raised its 1997 earnings estimate on the company to $1.30 a share from $1.10 and set a 1998 estimate of $1.60.</p>
<p>-- It set a 12-to-18 month price target of $16-$18 on the stock, which was up 3/8 at 12-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Noted company's announced stock buyback, reduced pension debt and &quot;undervalued&quot; shares.</p>
</text>
